  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:name" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:name:m0000" ref="07f_24w_7uz">廢帝</persName>諱<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:name:m0003" ref="07f_24w_7uz">奕</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:name:m0006" ref="07f_24w_7uz">延齡</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:name:m0009" ref="emb_vx4_gm9">哀帝</persName>之母弟也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:decree" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">己酉，集百官于朝堂，宣<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-succession:decree:m0011" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAB">崇德太后</persName>令曰：</p>
